{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong><i>Monstrix TCG Card Shop</i></strong>, you take on the role of a card collector shop owner, managing every aspect of your own trading card store. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stock your shelves with the latest trading card packs, exclusive figurines of beloved game characters, and rare collectibles. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customise your shop\u2019s interior to attract more customers and create the ultimate card shop experience. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your business as your popularity grows\u2014unlock larger spaces and design unique areas for players to come in and play the trading card game right in your store! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not only can you run a thriving shop, but you can also curate your own personal card collection, hunting down rare cards to show off or trade. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become the top destination for collectors, players, and fans in <strong>Monstrix TCG Card Shop</strong>!</h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Rising Retailer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3309130/3f6bf327772ed89415137b245fb443beea8e6e23.jpg"},{"name":"Friendly Faces","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3309130/289984dab1d0537e9bd6ca5a389a1f4998583944.jpg"},{"name":"Expansion Beginnings","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3309130/28cd0941e75abeb55daa93d3d0b4af3dc1fc28f7.jpg"},{"name":"First Hire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3309130/2dca0eb72d9535187501bb3e1639b683e072fc6d.jpg"},{"name":"First Fortune","path":"ht